msgid "[link]"
msgstr "[link]"

#. module: mass_mailing_themes
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mass_mailing_themes.theme_roadshow1_template
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mass_mailing_themes.theme_roadshow2_template
msgid "[speaker] &amp; [speaker]"
msgstr "[speaker] &amp; [speaker]"

#. module: mass_mailing_themes
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mass_mailing_themes.theme_roadshow1_template
msgid ""
"[speaker] and [speaker] will rely on a unique demo concept in which YOU lead "
"the demo and choose what you wish to see. They'll show how to tackle the "
"challenge using the best tools, live. You will be amazed!"
msgstr ""
"[speaker] ແລະ [speaker] ຈະນຳສະເໜີຜ່ານຮູບແບບການສາທິດທີ່ເປັນເອກະລັກ ໂດຍທີ່ ທ່ານ ຈະເປັນຜູ້ນຳພາ"
"ການສາທິດ ແລະ ເລືອກສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານຢາກເບິ່ງ. ພວກເຂົາຈະສະແດງວິທີແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາທີ່ທ້າທາຍໂດຍໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດແບບ"
"ສົດໆ. ທ່ານຈະຕ້ອງປະທັບໃຈແນ່ນອນ!"

#. module: mass_mailing_themes
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mass_mailing_themes.theme_newsletter_template
msgid ""
"and decided to stop our services for customers and focus on building a "
"strong partner network and maintenance offer. This would cost money, so I "
"had to raise a few million euros."
msgstr ""
"ແລະ ຕັດສິນໃຈຢຸດການໃຫ້ບໍລິການແກ່ລູກຄ້າໂດຍກົງ ແລ້ວຫັນມາເນັ້ນໃສ່ການສ້າງເຄືອຂ່າຍຄູ່ຮ່ວມທຸລະກິດທີ່ເຂັ້ມແຂງ ແລ"
"ະ ການໃຫ້ບໍລິການບຳລຸງຮັກສາລະບົບ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ທຶນ, ຂ້ອຍຈຶ່ງຕ້ອງລະດົມທຶນສອງສາມລ້ານເອີໂຣ."

#. module: mass_mailing_themes
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mass_mailing_themes.theme_newsletter_template
msgid ""
"asking; \"But why should we pay millions of dollars for a tiny software?\" "
"So, we renamed TinyERP to OpenERP."
msgstr ""
"ຖາມວ່າ: \"ແຕ່ເປັນຫຍັງພວກເຮົາຕ້ອງຈ່າຍເງິນຫຼາຍລ້ານໂດລາໃຫ້ກັບຊອບແວຕົວນ້ອຍໆ (tiny)?\" ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ພວກ"
"ເຮົາຈຶ່ງປ່ຽນຊື່ຈາກ TinyERP ມາເປັນ OpenERP."

#. module: mass_mailing_themes
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mass_mailing_themes.theme_terms_update_template
msgid ""
"believes good terms should be readable. If anything in the updated document "
"is unclear, reach out to us directly."
msgstr ""
"ເຊື່ອໝັ້ນວ່າຂໍ້ກຳນົດທີ່ດີຄວນຈະອ່ານເຂົ້າໃຈງ່າຍ. ຫາກມີສິ່ງໃດໃນເອກະສານສະບັບປັບປຸງນີ້ທີ່ບໍ່ຈະແຈ້ງ, ສາມາດຕິດຕໍ່ພວ"
"ກເຮົາໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ."

#. module: mass_mailing_themes
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mass_mailing_themes.theme_newsletter_template
msgid "bought the SorrySAP.com domain name"
msgstr "ຊື້ຊື່ໂດເມນ SorrySAP.com"

#. module: mass_mailing_themes
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mass_mailing_themes.theme_terms_update_template
msgid ""
"has also added clearer language around failed payment retries and grace "
"periods."
msgstr ""
"ຍັງໄດ້ເພີ່ມຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຈະແຈ້ງຍິ່ງຂຶ້ນ ກ່ຽວກັບການພະຍາຍາມຕັດເງິນໃໝ່ເມື່ອການຊຳລະບໍ່ສຳເລັດ ແລະ ໄລຍະເວລາຜ່ອນ"
"ຜັນ."

#. module: mass_mailing_themes
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mass_mailing_themes.theme_terms_update_template
msgid ""
"has clarified and limited the scope of data shared with third-party "
"partners. Going forward, only anonymized, aggregated usage data may be "
"shared for analytics purposes; no personally identifiable information, ever."
msgstr ""
"ໄດ້ກຳນົດ ແລະ ຈຳກັດຂອບເຂດຂອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈະແບ່ງປັນໃຫ້ກັບຄູ່ຮ່ວມງານພາກສ່ວນທີສາມຢ່າງຈະແຈ້ງ. ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້, ຈະມີພຽ"
"ງແຕ່ຂໍ້ມູນການນຳໃຊ້ລວມທີ່ບໍ່ລະບຸຕົວຕົນເທົ່ານັ້ນ ທີ່ອາດຈະຖືກແບ່ງປັນເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງໃນການວິເຄາະ; ໂດຍຈະບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສ"
"າມາດລະບຸຕົວຕົນໄດ້ເລີຍ."

#. module: mass_mailing_themes
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mass_mailing_themes.theme_roadshow2_template
msgid "here"
msgstr "ບ່ອນນີ້"

#. module: mass_mailing_themes
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mass_mailing_themes.theme_newsletter_template
msgid "in front of Danone's directors"
msgstr "ຕໍ່ໜ້າບັນດາຜູ້ອຳນວຍການຂອງ Danone"

#. module: mass_mailing_themes
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mass_mailing_themes.theme_terms_update_template
msgid ""
"is reducing the default data retention period from 5 years to 2 years. This "
"aligns with current privacy best practices and gives you more control over "
"your personal data. Archived accounts will be subject to the new timeline "
"starting June 1."
msgstr ""
"ກຳລັງຫຼຸດໄລຍະເວລາການເກັບຮັກສາຂໍ້ມູນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຈາກ 5 ປີ ລົງເຫຼືອ 2 ປີ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສອດຄ່ອງກັບແນວທາງການຮັກສາຄວ"
"າມເປັນສ່ວນຕົວທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດໃນປະຈຸບັນ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດຄວບຄຸມຂໍ້ມູນສ່ວນຕົວຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ບັນຊີທີ່ຖືກເກັບ"
"ໄວ້ຈະເລີ່ມນຳໃຊ້ກຳນົດເວລານີ້ຕັ້ງແຕ່ວັນທີ 1 ມິຖຸນາ."

#. module: mass_mailing_themes
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mass_mailing_themes.theme_roadshow2_template
msgid "or"
msgstr "ຫຼື"

#. module: mass_mailing_themes
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mass_mailing_themes.theme_newsletter_template
msgid "the fastest growing company of Belgium"
msgstr "ບໍລິສັດທີ່ເຕີບໂຕໄວທີ່ສຸດໃນປະເທດແບນຊິກ"

#. module: mass_mailing_themes
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mass_mailing_themes.theme_roadshow2_template
msgid "this page"
msgstr "ໜ້ານີ້"

#. module: mass_mailing_themes
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mass_mailing_themes.theme_roadshow2_template
msgid "watch our videos about the product"
msgstr "ເບິ່ງວິດີໂອຂອງພວກເຮົາກ່ຽວກັບຜະລິດຕະພັນ"

#. module: mass_mailing_themes
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mass_mailing_themes.theme_newsletter_template
msgid "we changed our business model"
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ປ່ຽນແປງຮູບແບບທຸລະກິດຂອງພວກເຮົາ"

#. module: mass_mailing_themes
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:mass_mailing_themes.theme_newsletter_template
msgid "with 1549% growth of the turnover between 2007 and 2011)."
msgstr "ດ້ວຍການເຕີບໂຕຂອງລາຍຮັບເຖິງ 1549% ໃນລະຫວ່າງປີ 2007 ຫາ 2011)."
